494	    $\text{{\igprimfont ⊣}}$: 12$+$ labels $\to$ 5 structural universals \\[1pt]
495	    $\text{{\igprimfont ⊥}}$: delaminated from $\text{{\igprimfont ⊤}}$ \\[1pt]
496	    $\text{{\igprimfont ⊡}}$: absent $\to$ added \\[1pt]
