1833	Symmetric informationally complete POVMs (SIC-POVMs) are sets of $d^2$ equiangular
1834	rank-1 projectors in $\mathbb{C}^d$. Numerical solutions exist in over a hundred
1835	dimensions; no uniform proof covers all $d$~\cite{afmy2017}. The grammar
1836	identifies the obstacle as a $\text{{\igprimfont <}}$-gap. The SIC conjecture in
1837	its unproven state and the proven SIC manifold imscribe respectively as:
1838	
1839	\begin{align}
