1872	grammar said crossing was impossible, by exactly the mechanism the grammar named
1873	in advance: the $\Ppms$-inhabiting arithmetic object is descended \emph{from},
1874	not approached by accumulation. The prediction and its execution are separated by
1875	the ordinary interval of doing the work, and the claim was made first.
