2200	sites joined by an irreducible topological connection) and \text{{\igfont 𐑵}}
2201	interaction grammar (global correlations, not mediated by a local carrier).  Bell
2202	inequality violation follows as a structural corollary: any local hidden-variable
2203	model requires $\text{{\igprimfont ⊣}} \leq \Tbw$ and \text{{\igfont 𐑝}} (local sequential grammar).
