2206	non-synthesizability theorem (\Cref{sec:frobenius}).  The grammar places Bell
2207	inequality violation on identical structural footing to the impossibility of
2208	synthesising $\Ppms$ from sub-Frobenius factors: a topology-governed structural
2209	ceiling, not a fine-tuned empirical coincidence.
